{"id":"baae414a-9950-407d-983c-62f5b50aa98e","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/tarballs.ts","baseline":{"blob":"d7aa763b5cd0cb318774e462d7feee1d27253c7c","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"e46e22f049b9d08c"}},"payload":{"text":"A package's published tarball, at the version the editor pins (versions.ts) — what a debug run's `require` installs\ninto its own memory when nothing in node_modules has the package (the bridge asks for it, for the debug worker:\n`packages.tarball`). Nothing is written to the workspace: its filesystem is a fixed-size shared buffer, too small for\nanyone's node_modules.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:02:43.027Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:02:43.027Z"}
